WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:10.520
AI systems can create risks involving privacy, security, bias, intellectual property, reliability, transparency, safety, and business decision-making.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:20.500
Unmanaged AI use can lead to shadow AI, sensitive data exposure, unsafe automation, unclear ownership, inconsistent evaluation, and poor incident handling.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:27.360
Governance helps organizations move from ad hoc experimentation to controlled, documented, and accountable AI use.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:30.940
This does not mean every use case needs heavy process.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:36.600
It means organizations need enough structure to understand what is happening and respond when risk changes.
